OL,3,GNEWSAThe tiger that stunned a seaside
OL,4,Atown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tiger brought to the UK in the 19th
OL,7,FCentury caused a stir before becoming a
OL,8,Fwell-known resident of a military
OL,9,Fbarracks, according to a local
OL,10,Fhistorian.
OL,12,FPhil Eyden has shared the story of a
OL,13,FBengal tiger cub called Plassey, which
OL,14,Fwas brought to Dover by British
OL,15,Fsoldiers.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
