OL,3,GNEWSAThe tiger that stunned a seaside
OL,4,Atown
OL,5,
OL,6,FEyden said troops adopted the cub after
OL,7,Fshooting its mother during a hunting
OL,8,Fexpedition. The adult tiger had been
OL,9,Fprotecting two six-week-old cubs in the
OL,10,FTerai foothills of India, an area now
OL,11,Fknown for its wildlife and tiger
OL,12,Freserves.
OL,14,FThe soldiers from the 5th Lancers gave
OL,15,Fone of the cubs to the 102nd Royal
OL,16,FMadras Fusiliers, which brought the
OL,17,Fanimal to England, where it became a
OL,18,Fregimental pet at Dover's Western
OL,19,FHeights.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
